     "html": "Gai askea <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>31</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo></mrow></math> da (<math display=\"inline\"><mi>A</mi></math>-n <math display=\"inline\"><mi>x</mi></math>-en zutabearen ordez gai askeena jarrita). Laburrean, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo></mrow></math>; <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math> denez, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo></mrow></math>."
